  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- `DateOnly`/`TimeOnly` `TryParse` and `TryParseExact` now throw `ArgumentException` for an invalid `DateTimeStyles` value instead of silently returning `false`, matching `Parse`/`ParseExact` and upstream behavior.\n- `ParseExact`/`TryParseExact` overloads taking an array of formats now validate every entry up front, so a malformed or empty trailing entry is caught even if an earlier entry in the array would have matched the input.\n- `TryParseExact` now throws `FormatException` for a malformed custom format string (e.g. an unterminated quoted literal) instead of silently returning `false`, matching `ParseExact`.\n- Added `IUtf8SpanFormattable` support (`TryFormat` into a `Span<byte>`) to `DateOnly`/`TimeOnly`, with an allocation-free fast path on netstandard2.1.",
